            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Keeping the car 2+ years"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Replacement eliminates future failure risk"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Multiple failures present"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Chain + turbo + injectors - repair each individually adds up"
